Z,7Z,10Z,13Z,16Z)-docosapentaenoate + H(+) + H2O + oxidized[NADPH--hemoprotein reductase]; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:52124, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11964, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11965, ChEBI:CHEBI:15377,ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:15379, ChEBI:CHEBI:57618,ChEBI:CHEBI:58210, ChEBI:CHEBI:77016, ChEBI:CHEBI:136411;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:19965576};PhysiologicalDirection=left-to-right; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:52125;Evidence={ECO:0000305|PubMed:19965576};CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=albendazole + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase]= H(+) + H2O + hydroxyalbendazole + oxidized [NADPH--hemoproteinreductase]; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:56288, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11964,Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11965, ChEBI:CHEBI:15377, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378,ChEBI:CHEBI:15379, ChEBI:CHEBI:16664, ChEBI:CHEBI:57618,ChEBI:CHEBI:58210, ChEBI:CHEBI:140182; EC=1.14.14.74;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:23959307};PhysiologicalDirection=left-to-right; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:56289;Evidence={ECO:0000305|PubMed:23959307};CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=albendazole + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase]= albendazole S-oxide + H(+) + H2O + oxidized [NADPH--hemoprotein reductase]; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:55924, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11964, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11965, ChEBI:CHEBI:15377,ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:15379, ChEBI:CHEBI:16664,ChEBI:CHEBI:16959, ChEBI:CHEBI:57618, ChEBI:CHEBI:58210;EC=1.14.14.73; Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:19923256};PhysiologicalDirection=left-to-right; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:55925;Evidence={ECO:0000305|PubMed:19923256};CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=fenbendazole + O2 + reduced [NADPH--hemoproteinreductase] = fenbendazole S-oxide + H(+) + H2O + oxidized[NADPH--hemoprotein reductase]; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:55928, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11964, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:11965, ChEBI:CHEBI:15377,ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:15379, ChEBI:CHEBI:35812,ChEBI:CHEBI:57618, ChEBI:CHEBI:58210, ChEBI:CHEBI:77092;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:23959307};PhysiologicalDirection=left-to-right; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:55929;Evidence={ECO:0000305|PubMed:23959307};COFACTOR:Name=heme; Xref=ChEBI:CHEBI:30413; Evidence={ECO:0000250};PATHWAY: Lipid metabolism; arachidonate metabolism.{ECO:0000269|PubMed:19737933, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19965576,ECO:0000269|PubMed:8631948}.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Endoplasmic reticulum membrane; Peripheralmembrane protein. Microsome membrane {ECO:0000269|PubMed:8631948};Peripheral membrane protein.TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Highly expressed in heart, present at lowerlevels in liver, kidney and skeletal muscle (at protein level).{ECO:0000269|PubMed:8631948}.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the cytochrome P450 family. {ECO:0000305}.WEB RESOURCE: Name=Cytochrome P450 Allele Nomenclature Committee;Note=CYP2J2 alleles;URL=&quot;http://www.cypalleles.ki.se/cyp2j2.htm&quot;;WEB RESOURCE: Name=NIEHS-SNPs;URL=&quot;http://egp.gs.washington.edu/data/cyp2j2/&quot;; COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
