 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An oxooctadecadienoic acid that consists of 9Z,11E-octadecadienoic acid bearing an additional 13-keto substituent. In addtion it has been found as a natural product found in Carthamus oxyacantha.</bp:comment>
